 The headsets, their capabilities and the commands that set them come from
 HeadsetControl (Denis Arnst "Sapd" and the contributors, GPL-3.0). HeadsetKontrol
 (TheBill2001, GPL-3.0), a Kirigami program for HeadsetControl, and the plasmoids
 headset-plasmoid (gort818) and plasmoid-headsetcontrol (lazy-stripes) were read
 for what such a front end shows; no code is copied from them.
